  m_text: "Speci\xE1ln\xED vyd\xE1n\xED talkshow Davida \u017Dilky p\u0159in\xE1\u0161\xED
    p\u0159\xEDmou debatu s l\xEDdrem strany, ve kter\xE9 moder\xE1tor\r\notev\xEDr\xE1
    citliv\xE1 t\xE9mata a konfrontuje ho s kontroverzn\xEDmi ot\xE1zkami. V pr\u016Fb\u011Bhu
    vys\xEDl\xE1n\xED nar\u016Fst\xE1\r\nnap\u011Bt\xED a atmosf\xE9ra ve studiu
    houstne, zat\xEDmco Emanuel Verdi obhajuje sv\xE9 kroky p\u0159ed zraky\r\nve\u0159ejnosti."
